  "deletedAt": null,
  "details": "1) Its difficult to properly align your head. There needs to be some kind of marker indicating the center of the head bone to help with aligning the head.\n2) Seeing past a skirt or dress to get your legs right is pretty much impossible without a mirror. So, proposal: When doing calibration, spawn a local-only mirror in front of the user's avatar at a meter or two distance. Maybe even cull/shrink other users for the moment so people don't get in the way.\n3) There should be a manual \"recalibrate\" button so I don't have to swap back and forth between avatars to fix a bad calibration.",
